   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Resistance mutations in aquatic plastisphere microbiomes\n",
    "\n",
    "All script files are located in `sbatch_files/`. \n",
    "\n",
    "Steps:\n",
    "1. Download the fastq data (specified in *download.txt*) using `download.sh` \n",
    "2. Run Pipeline 1, see TODO_URL_TO_IT for more details. TODO: Ok to link to it or just describe it?\n",
    "3. Download the card database using `download_card.sh`\n",
    "4. Build the database for MuMaMe using `mumame_build.sh`\n",
    "5. Run MuMaMe using `split_mumame.sh`, it will be grouped according to *beginning_filenames.txt*, in order to speed up the operation.\n",
    "6. The files *\\*.table.txt* and *\\*.per-mutation.txt* will be used below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Data analysis\n",
    "## Import data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 108,
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "r"
